301 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Before you begin your uphill trek to Tshokha, make sure to fuel up and hydrate well. This trail offers the adventure, as you ascend through the majestic Prek Chu River soaking in the scenery of beautiful magnolias and rhododendrons. Keep climbing amidst the wonders of nature until you reach Tshoka, a Tibetan settlement situated in the mountains. Upon arrival, settle into your campsite and later, head out to interact with the locals for a cultural experience before calling it a night.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
