313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Rise and shine amidst the scenic views of Tshokha! Get dressed to ascend from Tshoka to Dzongri, passing through the enchanting forests of rhododendrons. Next, make a quick stop at the Phedang village to relax your muscles before continuing on your journey. Later, as you walk towards Dzongri, take in the breathtaking views of Pandim and Ratong peaks. Upon arrival at the Dzongri, explore the nearby areas to learn about the rich culture before you settle into your camp for an overnight stay.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
